cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "MS-PDViT: a multi-scale patch-wise-decoder vision transformer for radar-only lightning nowcasting"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of MS-PDViT, a vision transformer that predicts dense
  pixel-level lightning probability fields for six 6-minute lead times from radar
  observations alone. Each spatial patch is decoded independently rather than
  reconstructing the output field from a single global classification token, and
  two patch scales are combined with fixed uniform weights.
